@startuml OpenRing-Module-Boundaries
' ===========================================================
' Module boundaries: OpenRing Desktop
' Shows ownership between UI, overlay, history, storage, BLE,
' protocol parsing, and measurement scheduling.
' ===========================================================

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

component "UI\nlib/src/ui" as UI
component "Overlay\nlib/src/overlay" as Overlay
component "History\nlib/src/history" as History
component "Measurement Scheduler\nlib/src/measurements" as Measurements
component "Storage\nlib/src/storage" as Storage
component "BLE Service\nlib/src/ble" as BLE
component "Protocol\nlib/src/protocol" as Protocol
component "Colmi Ring" as Ring

UI --> Measurements : desired measurements
Overlay --> Measurements : lightweight live profile
Measurements --> UI : latest values + freshness
Measurements --> BLE : serialized start/stop commands

UI --> BLE : scan/connect/disconnect via use cases
UI --> Storage : load persisted state
History --> Storage : load history models

BLE --> Protocol : parse notifications
Protocol --> BLE : build command packets
BLE --> Ring : Nordic UART BLE
Ring --> BLE : notifications

Measurements --> Storage : persist live readings
BLE --> Storage : persist device/battery/log data\nthrough controller/repository

note right of Protocol
Pure deterministic packet
builders and parsers.
end note

note bottom of UI
Widgets should not send
BLE commands directly.
end note

@enduml
